      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Elon Musk in new interview with Walter Isaacson on the wealth he's created:\n\n\"A fundamental misunderstanding of economics arises because of conflating resource allocation and consumption; I've created. My so-called wealth is simply a percentage ownership in SpaceX and Tesla. And this is going to be taxed quite heavily, and there's not some magical way to avoid taxes. If there were I would know about it. At the end of the day, this will get whittled down, and a few generations from now, if money still matters, which I don't think it will, my descendants would have a tiny fraction of what I have.\"",
      "quote": null,
