        "text": "The Grok Bot wave. Massive growth in just a few days.\n\nWhy? \n\nIt is the easiest most accessible agent platform thus built, and it keeps getting better,\n\nI am not guessing, I have been using agent systems before we had LLMs and today I can use any bot, but I find @Grok @Bot to be the best on all my test points.\n\nIt has not retreated from anything I threw at it. But that’s only half of it. The suggestions are great and unlike any other platform.\n\nThe chart is a wave and I say catch it…",
